title: Justice and the Rule of Law
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: spd_in_government = 1 and justice_minister_party = "SPD" and judiciary_timer = 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; judiciary_timer += 6
card-image: img/portraits/RadbruchGustav.jpg
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet

= Justice and the Rule of Law

The courts are overloaded and short of judges, and proceedings against extremist networks drag on for years. At the same time, experts warn that a future AfD majority could pack the Federal Constitutional Court, as happened in Poland and Hungary.

[? if judicial_reform <= 0 : Many of our members want us to protect the courts before it is too late, even if this leads to a dispute with our partners. ?]
[? if judicial_reform == 1 : We have started to reform the justice system, but more remains to be done. ?]
[? if judicial_reform >= 2 : The courts are better equipped, and the rules of the Constitutional Court are written into the Basic Law, where a simple majority cannot change them. ?]

- @reform: Protect the Constitutional Court in the Basic Law and hire more judges and prosecutors.
- @minor_reforms: Hire more judges and prosecutors.
- @as_is: Leave the justice system as it is.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@reform
subtitle: -1 budget. Needs a two-thirds majority, so the Union must agree.
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough budget.
choose-if: budget >= 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1; democratization += 2; coalition_dissent += 1 if in_grand_coalition == 1; workers_spd += 5*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3; judicial_reform += 2; trust_in_democracy += 5*(1-dissent); afd_relation -= 5; cdu_relation -= 2

We write the term limits, the election rules and the size of the Constitutional Court into the Basic Law, and fund new posts in the courts. The AfD calls it a plot by the old parties, and conservatives in the Union grumble about the cost.

@minor_reforms
on-arrival: democratization += 1; workers_spd += 3*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3; judicial_reform += 1; trust_in_democracy += 3*(1-dissent); judiciary_timer += 6

We fund new posts for judges and prosecutors. It is slow work, but the backlog begins to fall.

@as_is
go-to: root
